.TH tkutlsort n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutlsort
.PP
Type\-aware column sorting for a \fBtablelist\fR widget. tablelist sorts
dictionary/ASCII by default, mis\-ordering numeric and currency columns;
\fBtkutlsort\fR sets the right \fB\-sortmode\fR per column, including a
\fBnum\fR mode that compares human numbers via \fBtclutils::tunum\fR.
.SS Commands
.CS
::tkutils::tkutlsort::column  tbl col type ?cmd?
::tkutils::tkutlsort::columns tbl {col type col type ...}
.CE
.SS Types
.PP
\fBstring\fR (dictionary), \fBnocase\fR (asciinocase), \fBinteger\fR, \fBreal\fR,
\fBnum\fR (human/currency via tunum), \fBcommand\fR (your 2\-arg proc in ?cmd?).
.SS Example
.CS
::tkutils::tkutlsort::columns .t {0 string 1 num 2 integer}
.t sortbycolumn 1 -increasing
.CE
.SS "Error codes"
\fB\-errorcode {TKUTILS TKUTLSORT <REASON>}\fR (TYPE, CMD, SPEC).
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkutlfmt(n), tclutils::tunum(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
tablelist, sort, numeric, currency
